and the heap counted by allocator; the gate fails when an estimate is over its target. A point query is `reverse_in_country` (10 nearest), `admin_at`, `tz_at` and `elevation_at`; the page cache is warm, as on a relaunch."},"716":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-57","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"Measured 2026-11-15 on Darwin arm64, 10 cores (load average 7.63), commit `41ba69a`, by `cargo xtask phone world-np-lite.tgd --record`."},"717":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-58","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"open · 133.75µs · 869.38µs · 50ms","table":"table-5"},"718":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-59","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first queries · 6.06ms · 39.40ms · 150ms","table":"table-5"},"719":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-60","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first get · 809.79µs · 5.26ms · –","table":"table-5"},"720":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-61","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first reverse · 2.21ms · 14.39ms · –","table":"table-5"},"721":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-62","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first admin_at · 458.00ns · 2.98µs · –","table":"table-5"},"722":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-63","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first tz_at · 31.62µs · 205.56µs · –","table":"table-5"},"723":{"id":"/docs/data/measured-64","page_id":"/docs/data/measured","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/data/measured#phone-class-estimates","content":"first elevation_at · 286.42µs · 1.86ms · –","table":"table-5"},"7