h `reverse` and `admin_at`, around a place with `nearby`; climb with `hierarchy` and descend with `children`. Places are named by IDs such as tgd:np/1xhb: pass them to `get_place`, `lookup`, `nearby`, `timezone` or read teigeodata://place/\\{id\\}. Coordinates are WGS84 degrees, distances metres, heights metres above EGM2008. A long answer has a `next_cursor`: call the same tool with only `cursor` for the next page. Show the `attribution` of an answer wherever its data is shown: the licences require it."},"1405":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-25","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"search · Search places by name","table":"table-0"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-26","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"reverse · Places nearest a point","table":"table-0"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-27","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"nearby · Places near a place","table":"table-0"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-28","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"get_place · A place by ID","table":"table-0"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-29","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"lookup · Places by IDs","table":"table-0"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-30","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"admin_at · Admin units at a point","table":"table-0"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-31","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"hierarchy · Ancestors of a place","table":"table-0"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-32","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"children · Children of a pla